# __PROJECT_NAME__

A small web app bootstrapped with [Boring Stack](https://boringstack.org/).

## Run locally

```sh
boringstack dev
```

Or run Go directly:

```sh
go run .
```

Open <http://localhost:8080>. Health check: <http://localhost:8080/healthz>.

## Test

```sh
go test ./...
```

## Deploy

Review `deploy/README.md`, prepare a VPS, then run:

```sh
boringstack doctor --deploy
boringstack deploy --host deploy@your-vps.example.com \
  --healthz https://your-domain.example.com/healthz
```

## Stack

The decisions and migration paths are recorded in [STACK.md](STACK.md). The
defaults come from the [Boring Stack manifesto](https://boringstack.org/manifesto.html).
